Confirming - A note on filer support volumes. Requests for access code rese=
ts rise sharply around the annual amendment deadline and the queue lengthen=
s accordingly. If a registrant contacts you directly about codes, route the=
m to filer support rather than raising a ticket on their behalf; the ticket=
 has to come from the filer. Correspondence should be addressed to this off=
ice rather than to individual staff.